{"unit_id":"elfgzp__dsh-branch-worktree#card-zh","repo":"elfgzp/dsh-branch-worktree","commit":"f02e680d7e0febfe4ae7ec02e821dcb57721e9bd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Branch & Worktree 是一款面向 DSH Web 的分支与 worktree 插件。在新建会话区域，它加入分支选择控件，可选已有分支或输入新分支，并能自动生成分支名、预览路径。启用 worktree 后会创建独立检出并注册为 DSH 工作区；也可关闭开关，在干净的当前检出中切换分支。运行中的会话还可通过底部状态栏移入新 worktree。适合需要并行处理代码、希望每个会话使用独立 Git 工作目录的开发者；需要本机 Git。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:843-855","index.js:569-642","index.js:655-734"]}
{"unit_id":"elfgzp__dsh-branch-worktree#card-en","repo":"elfgzp/dsh-branch-worktree","commit":"f02e680d7e0febfe4ae7ec02e821dcb57721e9bd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Branch & Worktree adds branch controls to DSH Web. Choose or create a Git branch, preview an automatic name, and start a session in a registered worktree. It also supports in-place switching and moving a running session into a worktree. Requires Git.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:843-855","index.js:569-642","index.js:655-734"]}
